---
import Author from '../Author.astro';
---

<div class='grid w-full items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(13rem,14rem)_minmax(0,1fr)]'>
	<p class='col-span-full m-0 text-sm font-bold uppercase leading-[1.2] tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-muted max-sm:col-auto'>About the author</p>
	<Author />
	<div class='mt-0 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.8] text-zinc-600'>
		<p>
			Hanif is a Forward Deployed Engineer with 9+ years of experience building web, mobile, automation, and AI systems. He works directly with clients on discovery, workflow software, integrations, and production AI.
		</p>
	</div>
</div>
